<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to Handla</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0a0a0f; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: rgba(15,15,30,0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #4f46e5 50%, #0891b2 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; }
    .header p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 15px; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .welcome-msg { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .features { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 32px; }
    .features li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.1); font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1; }
    .features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .feature-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .cta-wrapper { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 44px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 12px; padding: 0 40px 32px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .footer a { color: #818cf8; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to Handla 👋</h1>
      <p>Your software services partner</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="welcome-msg">
        Hi <strong style="color:#e2e8f0;">{{userName}}</strong>, we're thrilled to have you on board!
        Your account is all set and ready to go. Here's what you can do with Handla:
      </p>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>
          <span class="feature-icon">💬</span>
          <div><strong>Real-time Chat</strong> — Connect directly with our team for instant support and project discussions.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feature-icon">📎</span>
          <div><strong>File Sharing</strong> — Attach and share files up to 5 MB directly in your conversations.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feature-icon">🔔</span>
          <div><strong>Smart Notifications</strong> — Get notified instantly whenever you receive a reply.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feature-icon">🌐</span>
          <div><strong>Bilingual Support</strong> — Our platform supports both English and Arabic.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="cta-btn">Go to My Dashboard →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Questions? Reply to this email or visit <a href="{{baseUrl}}">handla.com</a>.</p>
      <p>© {{year}} Handla. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
